{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22247","headline":"山中独吟 · 白居易","name":"山中独吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"人各有一癖，我癖在章句。\n万缘皆已消，此病独未去。\n每逢美风景，或对好亲故。\n高声咏一篇，恍若与神遇。\n自爲江上客，半在山中住。\n有时新诗成，独上东岩路。\n身倚白石崖，手攀青桂树。\n狂吟惊林壑，猿鸟皆窥覰。\n恐爲世所嗤，故就无人处。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22247.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22247","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}